      "message": "refactor(tools): name each tool kind in the kind rules, with no catch-all\n\nTool::kind_rule ended with `_ => None`, so a new ToolKind passed the\ncheck with no kind rule. The last arm now names each kind without a rule\n(or whose guarded rules held). A new kind does not compile until the\nmatch names it. The test kind list is guarded by an exhaustive\nkind_slot match and the_sweep_list_holds_each_kind_once.\n\nFixes #2505\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
